# Colang definitions for the guardrail configuration.
#
# `define bot refuse to respond` provides the canonical refusal message used by
# the built-in `self check input` and `self check output` flows when a block
# occurs. Keeping it here (instead of relying only on the library default)
# makes the refusal wording explicit and easy to adjust for this deployment.

define bot refuse to respond
  "I'm sorry, I can't respond to that."
